    "description_raw": "The transmuted creature becomes wiser. The spell grants a +4 enhancement bonus to Wisdom, adding the usual benefit to Wisdom-related skills. Clerics, druids, and rangers (and other Wisdom-based spellcasters) who receive owl’s wisdom do not gain any additional bonus spells for the increased Wisdom, but the save DCs for their spells increase.\nOwl’s Wisdom, Mass\n\nSchool transmutation; Level cleric/oracle 6, druid 6, psychic 6, shaman 6, sorcerer/wizard 6, summoner 4, unchained summoner 6; Mystery lore 6",
